Z||000000||theogre||01-27-2001||02:32 PM||||There is a new section in Tunnel #6, The Fiero Cave. Heat Management is located at the top of the menu. (Yes, added it to the WebTV index as well. The pages are short and there is no Java. It should work even with the old consoles.) <A HREF="http://fierocave.shorturl.com" TARGET=_blank>The Ogre's Fiero Cave</A><P>This new area will pull together the issues regurading Fiero heat problems and options to deal with it.<P>Heat articles in other areas of the cave will be updated deleted or moved to the new area over the next couple weeks. I'll also add the wiring for adding a vent grate fan.<p>[This message has been edited by theogre (edited 01-27-2001).]||||reg||6
